# --- Gitallow Pattern ---
# 1. Ignore everything by default
*

# 2. Allow descending into directories
!*/

# 3. Allow specific file extensions and hidden files
!.*
!*.jl
!*.md
!*.toml
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!*.json
!*.txt

# 4. Allow specific files without extension
!LICENSE
!justfile

# 5. Re-ignore specific things we definitely don't want
.git/
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.specify/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
spec.md
specs/
Manifest.toml
docs/build/
docs/site/
coverage/
*.cov
*.tar.gz
*.swp
